\par\par \b \uc2 Walmart\uc2  Cuts Jobs, Limits Remote Working\b0\par\par\uc2 By Sarah Nassauer \par \uc2 281 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 May 2024\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B1\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2024 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Walmart\uc2  is cutting hundreds of corporate jobs and asking most remote workers to move to offices, according to people familiar with the matter.\par \par \uc2 In addition, workers in small offices in Dallas, Atlanta and Toronto are being asked to move to other central hubs like \uc2 Walmart\uc2 's corporate headquarters in Bentonville, Ark., as well as Hoboken, N.J. or northern California, said one of the people familiar with the matter. \uc2 Walmart\uc2  will still allow staff to work remotely part of the time as long as they are in offices most of the time.\par \par \uc2 Walmart\uc2  is the country's largest employer, with 1.6 million U.S. workers, most of them in stores and warehouses. \uc2 Walmart\uc2  has tens of thousands of corporate workers across the country.\par \par \uc2 Like other companies, \uc2 Walmart\uc2  has gradually moved away from remote work flexibility. It has also shrunk the number of smaller offices scattered around the country. Last year, it closed three tech offices and asked some staff to relocate to central corporate hubs.\par \par \uc2 Walmart\uc2  has worked to cut costs over the past year in some areas as it gives priority to spending elsewhere. Last month, the company said it would shut all 51 of the health clinics it has opened over the past five years as it tried to build a bigger healthcare business.\par \par \uc2 The clinics, often located directly next to stores, offered primary care services and telehealth appointments. Last year, \uc2 Walmart\uc2  said it was planning to have 75 of the clinics by the end of 2024.\par \par \uc2 Walmart\uc2  said last month that rising operating costs and a challenging reimbursement environment "make the care business unsustainable for us at this time."\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020240514ek5e0001o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
